CubeTimer includes a local, adapted port of the 3x3 random-state scramble
generation path from TNoodle-lib 0.19.2.

Source: https://github.com/thewca/tnoodle-lib
Reference revision: v0.19.2
Imported modules: min2phase (cs.min2phase), plus a small Kotlin adapter based
on ThreeByThreeCubePuzzle's random-state generation contract.

